@startuml
title State Machine: Trip
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
state Completed
state InTransit
state Planned
state Released

[*] --> Planned
Planned --> Released : DispatchTrip
Planned --> Released : Release (ReleaseVehicle)
Released --> InTransit : Start (StartRoute)
InTransit --> Completed : Complete (FinishRoute)
@enduml
